Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 06:07:29 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240] | Words: 6  | Text: 又遇到過這種人
Segment #2   [00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,740] | Words: 8  | Text: 你講道理他就翻臉
Segment #3   [00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,360] | Words: 7  | Text: 你只是想好好說件事
Segment #4   [00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,660] | Words: 6  | Text: 他卻覺得你在找查
Segment #5   [00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,660] | Words: 9  | Text: 你百事實他聽成條性
Segment #6   [00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,400] | Words: 10 | Text: 你講邏輯他感到被冒犯
Segment #7   [00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,680] | Words: 5  | Text: 不是他聽不懂
Segment #8   [00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,820] | Words: 6  | Text: 而是他不能接受
Segment #9   [00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:12,960] | Words: 3  | Text: 自己可能錯
Segment #10  [00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,460] | Words: 9  | Text: 這種人可以叫第一認知群體
Segment #11  [00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,600] | Words: 5  | Text: 他們最在意的
Segment #12  [00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,120] | Words: 6  | Text: 不是真相是臉面
Segment #13  [00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,460] | Words: 5  | Text: 道理可以慢慢說
Segment #14  [00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,020] | Words: 9  | Text: 但面子必須當場保住
Segment #15  [00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,940] | Words: 11 | Text: 哪怕這份面子薄的相當值
Segment #16  [00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,240] | Words: 6  | Text: 也不能被你碰一下
Segment #17  [00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,440] | Words: 5  | Text: 你與其在軟
Segment #18  [00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,880] | Words: 9  | Text: 只要碰到他的知識盲區
Segment #19  [00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,620] | Words: 7  | Text: 他就會認定你在炫耀
Segment #20  [00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,460] | Words: 3  | Text: 你在壓他
Segment #21  [00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,820] | Words: 7  | Text: 在他的認知系統裡
Segment #22  [00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,200] | Words: 6  | Text: 認錯等於認輸
Segment #23  [00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,440] | Words: 5  | Text: 接受你的觀點
Segment #24  [00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,420] | Words: 6  | Text: 等於向你低頭
Segment #25  [00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,920] | Words: 5  | Text: 所以證據再應
Segment #26  [00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,500] | Words: 8  | Text: 他也要用情緒定回去
Segment #27  [00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,780] | Words: 6  | Text: 他不是在找答案
Segment #28  [00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,380] | Words: 9  | Text: 他是在互助那個脆弱的自己
Segment #29  [00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:41,680] | Words: 4  | Text: 他們相信的東西
Segment #30  [00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,940] | Words: 6  | Text: 像刻在石頭上
Segment #31  [00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,200] | Words: 6  | Text: 新興息進不去
Segment #32  [00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,220] | Words: 7  | Text: 就有觀念出不來
Segment #33  [00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,660] | Words: 6  | Text: 你想拆開他的邏輯
Segment #34  [00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,960] | Words: 8  | Text: 他立刻把你當敵人
Segment #35  [00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,320] | Words: 6  | Text: 先置疑你的動機
Segment #36  [00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,460] | Words: 6  | Text: 再攻擊你的態度
Segment #37  [00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,100] | Words: 7  | Text: 最後用最想的情緒
Segment #38  [00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,360] | Words: 8  | Text: 壓過最冷靜的分析
Segment #39  [00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,460] | Words: 4  | Text: 更麻煩的是
Segment #40  [00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,760] | Words: 7  | Text: 他們永遠向你收縮
Segment #41  [00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,700] | Words: 5  | Text: 絕不向外卡
Segment #42  [00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,280] | Words: 8  | Text: 除了問題不找外部原因
Segment #43  [00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,520] | Words: 8  | Text: 也不接受新的解釋
Segment #44  [00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,880] | Words: 7  | Text: 只用自己那套邏輯
Segment #45  [00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,980] | Words: 5  | Text: 把一切援回去
Segment #46  [00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,100] | Words: 5  | Text: 你苦口薄心
Segment #47  [00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,440] | Words: 8  | Text: 像一拳打在棉花上
Segment #48  [00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,460] | Words: 4  | Text: 他反而覺得
Segment #49  [00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:06,100] | Words: 1  | Text: 你看
Segment #50  [00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,400] | Words: 6  | Text: 你就是無理取鬧
Segment #51  [00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:08,600] | Words: 6  | Text: 心裡學有個詞
Segment #52  [00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,700] | Words: 5  | Text: 叫確認偏悟
Segment #53  [00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:11,760] | Words: 11 | Text: 他們只挑能證明自己對的信息
Segment #54  [00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,820] | Words: 6  | Text: 對相反的證據
Segment #55  [00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:13,640] | Words: 4  | Text: 自動平壁
Segment #56  [00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,800] | Words: 5  | Text: 跟這樣的人爭論
Segment #57  [00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:15,940] | Words: 7  | Text: 就像對下重講兵
Segment #58  [00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,060] | Words: 5  | Text: 他沒見過兵
Segment #59  [00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:18,160] | Words: 6  | Text: 也理解不了寒冷
Segment #60  [00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,580] | Words: 6  | Text: 只會覺得你在胡說
Segment #61  [00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:20,760] | Words: 4  | Text: 最累的是你
Segment #62  [00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,560] | Words: 5  | Text: 你本想幫他
Segment #63  [00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 最後卻把自己
Segment #64  [00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,400] | Words: 6  | Text: 拖進情緒逆彈
Segment #65  [00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,640] | Words: 6  | Text: 其他游言不盡
Segment #66  [00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,980] | Words: 7  | Text: 又怪自己無能為例
Segment #67  [00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:26,940] | Words: 5  | Text: 一場對話下來
Segment #68  [00:01:26,940 --> 00:01:27,520] | Words: 3  | Text: 他沒變
Segment #69  [00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,560] | Words: 4  | Text: 你先跨了
Segment #70  [00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,080] | Words: 1  | Text: 所以
Segment #71  [00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,100] | Words: 5  | Text: 聰明人怎麼做
Segment #72  [00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:30,620] | Words: 3  | Text: 不爭論
Segment #73  [00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:31,280] | Words: 3  | Text: 不解釋
Segment #74  [00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:31,920] | Words: 3  | Text: 不糾纏
Segment #75  [00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,960] | Words: 4  | Text: 這不是冷血
Segment #76  [00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,700] | Words: 3  | Text: 是清醒
Segment #77  [00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:34,820] | Words: 4  | Text: 你的時間很貴
Segment #78  [00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,140] | Words: 7  | Text: 要留給能聽懂你
Segment #79  [00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,620] | Words: 7  | Text: 願意跟你好好說話的人
Segment #80  [00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,360] | Words: 8  | Text: 別再不想醒的人身上
Segment #81  [00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 浪費你的清醒
Segment #82  [00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,640] | Words: 5  | Text: 記住兩句話
Segment #83  [00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,120] | Words: 1  | Text: 第一
Segment #84  [00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,140] | Words: 3  | Text: 不是每個人
Segment #85  [00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:44,300] | Words: 7  | Text: 都配得上你的解釋
Segment #86  [00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:44,920] | Words: 1  | Text: 第二
Segment #87  [00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,180] | Words: 5  | Text: 不是每種認知
Segment #88  [00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:47,700] | Words: 9  | Text: 都能靠一場爭論改變
Segment #89  [00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,540] | Words: 8  | Text: 他活在自己的小世界裡
Segment #90  [00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:50,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 你進不去
Segment #91  [00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:50,940] | Words: 4  | Text: 也拉不出來
Segment #92  [00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:52,060] | Words: 6  | Text: 與其陪他消耗
Segment #93  [00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,900] | Words: 11 | Text: 不如把利己留給真正重要的人
Segment #94  [00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,320] | Words: 8  | Text: 和更值得成長的自己
Segment #95  [00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:55,980] | Words: 1  | Text: 好了
Segment #96  [00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:57,240] | Words: 7  | Text: 這裡是認知行不射
Segment #97  [00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,480] | Words: 5  | Text: 如果你覺得這番話
Segment #98  [00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,120] | Words: 4  | Text: 對你有幫助
Segment #99  [00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,260] | Words: 5  | Text: 請點贊關注
Segment #100 [00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,160] | Words: 4  | Text: 我們下期見
